# The leader words are legal identifiers, and `match`, `from` and `await` are names in
# shipped examples (examples/grep.oq, examples/hanoi.oq). The refusal is contextual: it
# needs the operand the construct would take. A bare name, an assignment, a loop variable
# and a parameter must all keep working, or this fix would have turned the diagnostic into
# the hard reservation it was written to avoid.
match = 5
print match
for match in [1, 2]
  print match
end
fun add(from, to)
  return from + to
end
print add(1, 2)
def = 7
print def
